      authors: Nima Sanandaji
      year: 2015
      finding: Argues the Nordic countries' high trust, work ethic and equality predate the large welfare state.
    - id: arv17
      title: Asymmetric Growth and Institutions in an Interdependent World
      authors: Daron Acemoglu, James A. Robinson, Thierry Verdier
      year: 2017
      finding: A model in which 'cutthroat' capitalism in the technology leader and 'cuddly' welfare-state capitalism in followers can coexist, the followers benefiting from the leader's innovation.
      doi: 10.1086/693038

